  "id": "2114069420301484543",
  "text": "I gave my Grok Bot $3,000 and went to sleep.\n\n9 hours later: $12,500.\n\n4.17x. And no single agent made that money alone. It's a relay.\n\nFive agents. Each one does one thing, then hands the coin to the next:\n\n> SCOUT finds every new pair on Solana. 14,200 tonight\n> ANALYST runs the rug and holder checks. Top 10 wallets over 30%, dead. Mint not revoked, dead. 312 survived\n> SNIPER enters the ones that pass. 0.4 second fills\n> RISK trails every open position and never lets a winner turn red\n> BANKER takes the exit and moves the profit off the table\n\nA coin has to get past all five. Most don't make it past the second.\n\n14,200 pairs found.\n312 passed the checks.\n118 trades taken.\n97 green. 21 red.\n\nThe first approval of the night was $TRUMP. A −34% wick, bids stacked underneath, 5 checks passed. SCOUT found it, ANALYST cleared it, SNIPER was in before the bounce.\n\nNobody on the desk does two jobs. Nobody skips a step. The scout can't buy, the sniper can't pick, and the banker doesn't care how good the chart looks.\n\nHour 0 - $3,000\nHour 3 - $4,800\nHour 6 - $8,900\nHour 9 - $12,500\n\nI woke up. The relay never stopped.\n\nThe whole build is in the post below ↓",
  "raw_text": {
   "text": "I gave my Grok Bot $3,000 and went to sleep.\n\n9 hours later: $12,500.\n\n4.17x. And no single agent made that money alone. It's a relay.\n\nFive agents. Each one does one thing, then hands the coin to the next:\n\n> SCOUT finds every new pair on Solana. 14,200 tonight\n> ANALYST runs the rug and holder checks. Top 10 wallets over 30%, dead. Mint not revoked, dead. 312 survived\n> SNIPER enters the ones that pass. 0.4 second fills\n> RISK trails every open position and never lets a winner turn red\n> BANKER takes the exit and moves the profit off the table\n\nA coin has to get past all five. Most don't make it past the second.\n\n14,200 pairs found.\n312 passed the checks.\n118 trades taken.\n97 green. 21 red.\n\nThe first approval of the night was $TRUMP. A −34% wick, bids stacked underneath, 5 checks passed. SCOUT found it, ANALYST cleared it, SNIPER was in before the bounce.\n\nNobody on the desk does two jobs. Nobody skips a step. The scout can't buy, the sniper can't pick, and the banker doesn't care how good the chart looks.\n\nHour 0 - $3,000\nHour 3 - $4,800\nHour 6 - $8,900\nHour 9 - $12,500\n\nI woke up. The relay never stopped.\n\nThe whole build is in the post below ↓",
