    "title": "Grok Bot Engineer: Every Memecoin Bot Has a Failure Mode. Find It Before the Market Does.",
    "preview_text": "Same three signals. One desk is flat after a rug. The other is down 12% and gave back both wins.\nHard rule: position size is a fixed fraction of the current book, never a function of the last trade.",
